      "id": "spell",
      "title": "Spell language",
      "icon": "language",
      "intro": "Working on spell code itself:  only the `spell` CLI does these;  VS Code's extension does some live.  `spell speedtest`:  see Typecheck, lint, format, test;  `spell help`:  see The CLI itself.",
      "rows": [
        {
          "op": "Compile a project to javascript",
          "cli": {
            "mark": "same",
            "names": ["spell compile"],
            "note": "and each `*.editor.html` to its `<type-editor>` module (epic `property-editor` P7)"
